# Trims the build context to nothing. The image copies no source - the tree
# arrives as a bind mount at run time - so sending the catalog export, the
# virtualenv and the generated playlists would cost minutes for nothing.
#
# BuildKit reads docker/Dockerfile out of band, so excluding everything here
# does not hide it. Adding a COPY to the Dockerfile means adding an allow line
# for the file it copies.
*
